   "giotto-card",
   {
    "title": "Giotto, in one card",
    "html": "<style>\nbody { padding: 64px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.kicker { font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--g-muted); }\nh1 { font-size: 76px; line-height: 1.02; margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\nh1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--g-accent); }\n.row { display: flex; gap: 22px; margin-top: auto; }\n.f { flex: 1; padding: 22px 24px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--g-fill); border: 2px solid var(--g-stroke); }\n.f b { display: block; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.f span { font-size: 18px; color: var(--g-muted); line-height: 1.35; }\n.f.a { border-color: var(--g-tone-blue); background: var(--g-tone-blue-fill); color: var(--g-tone-blue-text); }\n.f.b { border-color: var(--g-tone-green); background: var(--g-tone-green-fill); color: var(--g-tone-green-text); }\n.f.c { border-color: var(--g-tone-purple); background: var(--g-tone-purple-fill); color: var(--g-tone-purple-text); }\n.f.a span, .f.b span, .f.c span { color: inherit; opacity: .8; }\ncode { font-family: var(--g-code-font); font-size: 22px; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--g-accent); color: var(--g-on-accent); align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 28px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"kicker\">Giotto · an MCP canvas</div>\n<h1>Diagrams your agent draws.<br><em>Live</em>, while you watch.</h1>\n<code>npx skills add nicoloboschi/giotto</code>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"f a\"><b>No coordinates</b><span>Groups lay boxes out, arrows route around them.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"f b\"><b>Point, don't describe</b><span>Drag over an area, say what should change.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"f c\"><b>Ship it</b><span>SVG, PNG, animated SVG and MP4 exports.</span></div>\n</div>\n",
    "width": 1200,
    "height": 630,
    "elements": [],
    "selectedIds": []
   }
  ],
